l growth.","Forward indicators: deferred revenue down 72%.","Capex runs only 0.6x depreciation (1.6% of sales), so the asset base is being harvested rather than grown.","Its Rule of 40 score is -9, below the 40 that marks a healthy growth business."],"own":["Insiders own a modest 1.6%, and reported institutional holdings exceed 100% of shares (a sign of heavy share lending).","Insiders have only bought over the past year (3 purchases, net $848K bought).","The share count has grown 0.9% a year over five years, diluting existing holders.","Short interest is elevated at 10.1% of the float, 4.4 days to cover."],"people":["With about 14,800 employees, each generates about $505K of revenue, 1.4x the Industrials median, and productivity has risen 6.4% a year.","Free cash flow is negative, at -$85K per employee.","CEO pay is $1.4M (3x revenue per employee).","Stock compensation averages $4K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"INSUFFICIENT DATA","conv":null,"head":"Not enough data to value it: missing price or fair value.","pros":[],"cons":[],"flags":[],"need":[],"buy_below":null,"vc":null,"med":{"pe":23.2692,"ev_ebitda":13.319,"pfcf":22.2778,"pb":3.0551,"roic":0.1001,"gross_margin":0.2851,"fcf_margin":0.068,"div_yield":0.0147}},"ticker":"REZI","date":"2026-11-06"}